abstract: >-
  Exact C17 enumeration and independently checkable positive witnesses for the
  sixteen-term local prefix of OEIS A249107. Four completed stages cover
  380264132 through 30429212500 with fifty sealed segments and six additional
  consecutive terms. The package includes fixed-form scale analysis, eleven
  observed primitive ordered forms, finite trajectory results, original run
  evidence and runnable validators. Full negative coverage remains dependent
  on the executed implementation, its finite-domain primality premise and the
  inherited ten-term baseline; finite independent windows are explicitly scoped.
